  body
    iframe(src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/ns.html?id=GTM-PXHCM38Q" height="0" width="0" style="display:none;visibility:hidden")

    include ../../components/header/header
    +header({ linksHeader: linksHeader, contactUs: '/#contactUs' })

    main

      //- HERO — follows the same visual pattern as the About section
      section(data-color="white").founderHero.colorSection
        .founderHero__wrapper
          h6.subtitle.founderHero__subtitle._anim-items._anim-no-hide The People Behind ApolloRise
          h1.h1.founderHero__title._anim-items._anim-no-hide Two builders. One mission.
          p.text_1.founderHero__description._anim-items._anim-no-hide Not a corporation. Two people shaped by life, war, and relentless ambition — who turned personal hardship into a mission to build with soul.

      //- Yurii — dark card, photo left / content right
      section(data-color="dark").founderCard.colorSection
        .founderCard__inner
          .founderCard__photo._anim-items._anim-no-hide
            img(src=require('../../sources/images/yurii.png') alt="Yurii Kapkov" loading="lazy")
          .founderCard__content
            h6.subtitle.founderCard__role._anim-items._anim-no-hide Founder & CEO
            h2.h2.founderCard__name._anim-items._anim-no-hide Yurii Kapkov
            p.text_2.founderCard__story._anim-items._anim-no-hide
              | I grew up in Donetsk, Ukraine — a place that shaped my resilience early on. I wrote my first lines of code at 15 and never stopped. I graduated with a 96/100 GPA in Software Engineering, the highest in my faculty. I won sport programming championships. Led the Student Science Society. And from my very first year at university, I was shipping freelance projects every evening.
            p.text_2.founderCard__story._anim-items._anim-no-hide
              | I've lived in nearly 20 countries. Now I split my time between Israel and the US — waking up early, going to sleep late. ApolloRise is my life's work. Every wall I hit, I climb over. Every limit, I push through. I believe authentic hard work always wins.
            .founderCard__tags._anim-items._anim-no-hide
              span.founderCard__tag Donetsk → Israel & US
              span.founderCard__tag 10+ Years in IT
              span.founderCard__tag Software Architect
              span.founderCard__tag Founder & Team Leader
              span.founderCard__tag Relentless Execution

      //- IRINA — light card (yellowLight), photo left / content right
      section(data-color="white").founderCard.founderCard--light.colorSection
        .founderCard__inner
          .founderCard__photo._anim-items._anim-no-hide
            img(src=require('../../sources/images/irina.png') alt="Irina Zakharchenko" loading="lazy")
          .founderCard__content
            h6.subtitle.founderCard__role._anim-items._anim-no-hide Co-Founder & COO
            h2.h2.founderCard__name._anim-items._anim-no-hide Irina Zakharchenko
            p.text_2.founderCard__story._anim-items._anim-no-hide
              | 20+ years across healthcare, biotech, and SaaS. Co-founded DocsDNA before generative AI went mainstream. Served at Johnson & Johnson, Forbes 500's Basic Element, and led people operations at Better Therapeutics. Selected for Marquis Who's Who. Forbes Business Council member since 2025.
            p.text_2.founderCard__story._anim-items._anim-no-hide
              | Senior Chapter Chair, Women in Tech & Entrepreneurship, Orlando. Active in Orlando Tech Community and Women in Hospitality Leadership Alliance. She is the reason our clients feel like family — not customers.
            .founderCard__tags._anim-items._anim-no-hide
              span.founderCard__tag 20+ Years in Tech
              span.founderCard__tag Forbes Business Council
              span.founderCard__tag Marquis Who's Who
              span.founderCard__tag Women in Tech Leader
              span.founderCard__tag Orlando Community Builder

      //- MANIFESTO — dark, like contactUs but text-only
      section(data-color="dark").founderManifesto.colorSection
        .founderManifesto__inner
          h6.subtitle.founderManifesto__label._anim-items._anim-no-hide What we believe in
          h2.h2.founderManifesto__title._anim-items._anim-no-hide We are the embodiment of humanity in business.
          p.text_1.founderManifesto__text._anim-items._anim-no-hide
            | We are flexible. We always find a way. Everyone who has ever worked with us stays with us for years.
            | We don't just build software — we build relationships. We are proud of every single project we've ever shipped.
            | We are tired of fake. We chose authenticity. And we will keep going until we win.
          a(href="/#contactUs").button_yellow.size_m.founderManifesto__cta._anim-items._anim-no-hide
            p Let's Build Together

    include ../../components/footer/footer
    +footer({ linksFooter: linksFooter, contactUs: '/#contactUs' })
